  "details": "The [CinemachineVirtualCamera.m_Lens] script stopped working with an error after VRChat 2023.1.1.\n\nThe error message now reads\n\n\"\"\"\n\nNo AOT serializer was pre-generated for the type 'Cinemachine.LensSettings'. Please use Odin's AOT generation feature to generate an AOT dll before building, and ensure that 'Cinemachine.LensSettings' is in the list of supported types after a scan. If it is not, please report an issue and add it to the list manually.\n\n\"\"\"",
